# 本仓库的忽略规则（2026-09-24 重建：修掉两处非法 UTF-8 字节 E2 80 3F，本应为 em dash E2 80 94；
# 规则逐条保留原文，仅统一行尾为 LF 并补上 backups/ 与 publish_clean/）。
# 规则语义不变：outputs/ 配合下面的 negation 只让 JSON/TXT/CSV 结果入库，权重与大件排除。

# Large data files — do not commit raw datasets
flickr30k/
coco/
data/

# Model checkpoints (too large for git)
*.pt
models/

# Generated PDFs
*.pdf

# LaTeX temp files
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.blg
*.bbl
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex(busy)

# Experimental outputs (except analysis summaries)
# Experiment outputs — track JSON analysis, exclude checkpoints
outputs/
!outputs/**/*.json
!outputs/**/*.txt
!outputs/**/*.csv

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
.codegraph/
*.swp
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Claude
CLAUDE.md

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Temp/recovery files
check_env.py
recover_siglip.py

# HuggingFace dataset shards / parquet artifacts
*.parquet

# git filter-repo history-rewrite artifacts
.git-rewrite/

*.spl
main.log
main_zh.log
SUBMISSION/
abstract.log

# Local archive of unused scratch (91 MB of check residue) - never commit
备选/

# 本地归档与备份（2026-09-24 新增：13.7 GB 快照与重建的发布仓库不入库）
backups/
publish_clean/

# Python 虚拟环境（机器相关、可由 requirements 重建；envs/tf457 = transformers 4.57 对照环境，102.7 MB）
envs/

# 一次性临时产物
tools/_tmp_*.json

# ---- 2026-10-14 加固：权重 / 大文件 / 压缩包一律不入库 ----
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.h5
*.pkl
*.npz
*.npy
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.rar
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
*.log
# 云端目录快照（1001 个空壳文件）
outputs/_cloud_layout/
# 一次性/审计脚本的归档地（保留在库内，但不视为可重跑管线）
# tools/obsolete/

# docs/ 不入发布库（2026-10-14 操作者要求）
docs/
